e-e-o042d-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"徐晃夏侯渊平鄜夏阳斩梁兴","evidence":["zhangle-e-o042d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"征讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o042d-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0278","role":"征讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o042d-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0287","role":"被斩","evidence":["zhangle-e-o042d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"关右反时及以后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o042d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o042d-q","source_order":[17,148,"O042d"],"order":3588}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0287","name":"梁兴","evidence":["wudi-q-o137","zhangle-q-o030","guanzhang-q-p018","xiahoucao-q-o014","rensu-q-42866a87f5753636abb3","rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f","rensu-q-1459a5cde62b2017fc1d"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o137-wudi-p0287","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o137"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o030-wudi-p0287","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o030"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o042-wudi-p0287","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o042"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-p018-wudi-p0287","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p018"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o014-wudi-p0287","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o014"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-q-p018","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-107ac81294c6a7f9bb40","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《典略》曰：“建安十六年，超与关中诸将侯选、程银、李堪、张横、梁兴、成宜、马玩、杨秋、韩遂等，凡十部，俱反；其众十万，同据河、潼，建列营阵。是岁，曹公西征，与超等战于河、渭之交，超等败走。超至安定，遂奔凉州。诏收灭超家属。超复败于陇上，后奔汉中，张鲁以为都讲祭酒，欲妻之以女。或谏鲁曰：‘有人若此不爱其亲，焉能爱人？’鲁乃止。初，超未反时，其小妇弟种，留三辅；及超败，种先入汉中。正旦，种上寿于超。超捶胸吐血曰：‘阖门百口，一旦同命，今二人相贺邪！’后数从鲁求兵，欲北取凉州；鲁遣往，无利。又鲁将杨（白）〔昂〕等（欲）〔数〕害其能，超遂从武都逃入氐中，转奔往蜀。是岁，建安十九年也。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7c0270dd171b6d970305","start":0,"end":295,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"兴等惧，将余众聚鄜城","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":245,"end":255,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-1459a5cde62b2017fc1d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-948242ed44c316c89dfe","layer":"original","quote":"太祖使夏侯渊就助郡击之；浑率吏民前登，斩兴及其支党","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"又遣吏民有恩信者，分布山谷告喻。出者相继，乃使诸县长吏，各还本治以安集之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":208,"end":244,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-42866a87f5753636abb3","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"时梁兴等略吏民五千余家，为寇抄；诸县不能御，皆恐惧，寄治郡下","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"议者悉以为“当移就险”，浑曰：“兴等破散，窜在山阻。虽有随者，率胁从耳。今当广开降路，宣喻恩信；而保险自守，此示弱也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"乃聚敛吏民，治城郭，为守御之备。遂发民逐贼，明赏罚，与要誓；其所得获，十以七赏。百姓大悦，皆愿捕贼，多得妇女、财物","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":107,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"贼之失妻子者，皆还求降。浑责其得他妇女〖10〗，然后还其妻子；于是转相寇盗，党与离散","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o137b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4c8ba9bf8d7f6ff8015","layer":"original","quote":"马超余众梁兴等，屯蓝田〖6〗，使夏侯渊击平之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-32846c231ed2b04de76f","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o137","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4c8ba9bf8d7f6ff8015","layer":"original","quote":"十七年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。天子命公赞拜不名〖2〗，入朝不趋〖3〗，剑履上殿〖4〗：如萧何故事〖5〗。马超余众梁兴等，屯蓝田〖6〗，使夏侯渊击平之。割河内之荡阴、朝歌、林虑〖7〗，东郡之卫国、顿丘、东武阳、发干〖8〗，巨鹿之廮陶、曲周、南和、广平、（之）任（城）〖9〗，赵之襄国、邯郸、易阳，以益魏郡〖10〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3ae2b4b8fe9aea30d935","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o014","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"与太祖会安定，降杨秋。十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。马超围凉州刺史韦康于冀〖3〗，渊救康；未到，康败。去冀二百余里，超来逆战。军不利。汧氐反，渊引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o030f-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-3855d855bdd81918b067","layer":"original","quote":"与夏侯渊讨鄜贼梁兴及武都氐。又破马超，平宋建。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":109,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o042b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-8c77e7bb7badfaad69ba","layer":"original","quote":"太祖至潼关，恐不得渡，召问晃。晃曰：“公盛兵于此，而贼不复别守蒲坂，知其无谋也。今假臣精兵﹝二﹞，渡蒲坂津；为军先置，以截其里〖12〗：贼可擒也。”太祖曰：“善！”使晃以步骑四千人，渡津。作堑栅未成，贼梁兴夜将步骑五千余人攻晃；晃击走之，太祖军得渡，遂破超等。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o042d-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-8c77e7bb7badfaad69ba","layer":"original","quote":"太祖还邺，使晃与夏侯渊平鄜、夏阳余贼，斩梁兴，降三千余户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":189,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o030","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-3855d855bdd81918b067","layer":"original","quote":"拜郃偏将军，封都亭侯，授以众。从攻邺，拔之。又从击袁谭于勃海，别将军围雍奴，大破之。从讨柳城，与张辽俱为军锋，以功迁平狄将军〖4〗。别征东莱，讨管承；又与张辽讨陈兰、梅成等，破之。从破马超、韩遂于渭南。围安定，降杨秋。与夏侯渊讨鄜贼梁兴及武都氐。又破马超，平宋建。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o042","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-8c77e7bb7badfaad69ba","layer":"original","quote":"韩遂、马超等反关右，遣晃屯汾阴以抚河东〖10〗；赐牛酒，令上先人墓〖11〗。太祖至潼关，恐不得渡，召问晃。晃曰：“公盛兵于此，而贼不复别守蒲坂，知其无谋也。今假臣精兵﹝二﹞，渡蒲坂津；为军先置，以截其里〖12〗：贼可擒也。”太祖曰：“善！”使晃以步骑四千人，渡津。作堑栅未成，贼梁兴夜将步骑五千余人攻晃；晃击走之，太祖军得渡，遂破超等。使晃与夏侯渊平隃麋、汧诸氐，与太祖会安定。太祖还邺，使晃与夏侯渊平鄜、夏阳余贼，斩梁兴，降三千余户。从征张鲁。别遣晃讨攻椟、仇夷诸山氐〖13〗，皆降之。迁平寇将军〖14〗。解将军张顺围，击贼陈福等三十余屯，皆破之。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":275,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
